"into lines, and each non-blank, non-comment line is yielded after stripping "
"leading and trailing whitespace.  (Lines whose first non-blank character is "
"``#`` are considered comment lines.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../deprecated/pkg_resources.rst:1599
msgid ""
"If ``strs`` is not an instance of ``basestring``, it is iterated over, and "
