"nested sequence of strings, or sequences of sequences of strings can be "
"flattened out to the lines contained therein.  So for example, passing a "
"file object or a list of strings to ``yield_lines`` will both work. (Note "
"that between each string in a sequence of strings there is assumed to be an "
"implicit line break, so lines cannot bridge two strings in a sequence.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../deprecated/pkg_resources.rst:1608
